BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Digital Dharma Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260728T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260728T213000
UID:eb7da67d2e28d701ac83a5b5@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:The Buddha taught that the root cause of our suffering is crav
 ing. Nowadays one of the most striking ways to see this truth is paying at
 tention to our relationship to our phones. In this six-week course\, disco
 ver ancient practices and modern tools that help us to use technology more
  wisely and clear the way for a more meaningful life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/digital-dharma
END:VEVENT
